Domain Entity Calendar [545]
    documentation 'A set of dates associated with an organization. 
    string CalendarName
        documentation 'A description or identification of the calendar.
        is part of identity
        
    date Date [1271]
        documentation 'The month, day, and year of the CalendarDate.
        is part of identity
    reference School [2426]
        documentation 'The school for which the calendar event is defined.
        is part of identity
    include CalendarEvent [1270]
        documentation 'Additional description of the date such as date classification and duration of the event.
        is required collection